          "@type": "Question",
          name: "How do I reset my NordicTrack treadmill?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Remove the safety key, switch off at the power switch on the base, unplug for about a minute, then plug in, switch on and let the console boot fully. If it is completely dead, press in the reset breaker beside the power switch. A factory reset of the touchscreen is a bigger step; follow your model's manual or NordicTrack support for it.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Why is my NordicTrack iFIT screen frozen?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Most frozen screens clear with a full power cycle and a complete boot. A screen stuck on an update usually needs more time on a stronger Wi-Fi signal; avoid switching off mid-update. If it freezes at the same point every time, note what is on screen and contact support, which can recover the console.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Why is my NordicTrack incline not working?",
